What is the output of the following constructor delegation program?
```java
class BookOrder {
    int quantity;
    String code;
    BookOrder(String code) {
        this(code, 1);
    }
    BookOrder(String code, int quantity) {
        this.code = code;
        this.quantity = quantity;
    }
}
public class OrderMain {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        BookOrder bo = new BookOrder("BK-42");
        System.out.println(bo.code + ":" + bo.quantity);
    }
}
```

